與敦分為弟/族弟；原文齊王乂爵名抵牾另保候選。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangyan:p006","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-wangyan"},{"id":"c-sanguozhi-024-cuilin:p002:m0356","start":356,"end":357,"surface":"澄","kind":"person","person_id":"rlk_lzd_86c","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本段完整敘事、引語角色與明示近親官職辨識；非按同名批量合併。","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-024-cuilin:p002","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-024-cuilin"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangyan:p006","text":"衍素輕趙王倫之為人。及倫篡位，衍陽狂斫婢以自免。及倫誅，拜河南尹，轉尚書，又為中書令。時齊王乂有匡復之功，而專權自恣，公卿皆為之拜，衍獨長揖焉。以病去官。成都王穎以衍為中軍師，累遷尚書僕射，領吏部，後拜尚書令、司空、司徒。衍雖居宰輔之重，不以經國為念，而思自全之計。說東海王越曰：「中國已亂，當賴方伯，宜得文武兼資以任之。」乃以弟澄為荊州，族弟敦為青州。因謂澄、敦曰：「荊州有江、漢之固，青州有負海之險，卿二人在外，而吾留此，足以為三窟矣。」識者鄙之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangyan:p006:m0000","start":0,"end":1,"surface":"衍","kind":"person","person_id":"b0c_13f_c3a","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"趙王倫篡誅至成都王穎/東海王越，澄與敦分為弟/族弟；原文齊王乂爵名抵牾另保候選。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangyan:p006:m0003","start":3,"end":6,"surface":"趙王倫","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"趙王倫篡誅至成都王穎/東海王越，澄與敦分為弟/族弟；原文齊王乂爵名抵牾另保候選。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangyan:p006:m0011","start":11,"end":12,"surface":"倫","kind":"person","person_id":"dkn_ge4_286_AAAAG","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"趙王倫篡誅至成都王穎/東海王越，澄與敦分為弟/族弟；原文齊王乂爵名抵牾另保候選。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangyan:p006:m0015","start":15,"end":16,"surface":"衍","kind":"person","person_id":"b0c_13f_c3a","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"趙王倫篡誅至成都王穎/東海王越，澄與敦分為弟/族弟；原文齊王乂爵名抵牾另保候選。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-043-wangyan:p006:m0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"婢","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","resoluti